  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/florianus-abbas/pl72_46_fl#PL72.FL.2.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/florianus-abbas/pl72_46_fl",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.FL.2.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Benedicitur una Trinitas, Deus noster, qui vos pontificalibus meritis pontificali locavit in vertice, ut non beatitatem dignitas, sed beatitudo praecederet dignitatem.",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 555,
    "date_range": [
      550,
      560
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/florianus-abbas/pl72_46_fl#PL72.FL.2.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/florianus-abbas/pl72_46_fl",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.FL.2.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nec immerito : cum ab ineunte pueritia dominicis militaveris in castris, ut illuc tutius et validius diseretis, quibus jaculis intelligibilis ille prosternitur Amalech, scilicet quando et ipse victor es nomine.",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 555,
    "date_range": [
      550,
      560
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/florianus-abbas/pl72_46_fl#PL72.FL.2.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/florianus-abbas/pl72_46_fl",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.FL.2.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sic enim estis Deo præsule in statutis cœnobialibus eruditi, ut per mare saeculi sine sæcu­ laribus fluctibus inoffenso vestigio transiretis ,",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 555,
    "date_range": [
      550,
      560
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/florianus-abbas/pl72_46_fl#PL72.FL.2.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/florianus-abbas/pl72_46_fl",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.FL.2.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "et triumphalem hymnum cum Moyse merito concinen­ tes : Cantemus Domino, gloriose enim honorificatus est; equum et ascensorem projecit in mare.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 555,
    "date_range": [
      550,
      560
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/florianus-abbas/pl72_46_fl#PL72.FL.2.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/florianus-abbas/pl72_46_fl",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.FL.2.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sic indi­ viduus comes Eliæ, ut nequaquam deserens altiora, quo humilitate conscenderas, unde cum apostolis in montem glorificatum aspiceres Dominum Salvato­ rem.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 555,
    "date_range": [
      550,
      560
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/florianus-abbas/pl72_46_fl#PL72.FL.2.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/florianus-abbas/pl72_46_fl",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.FL.2.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quia igitur tantae sanctimoniæ vestrae praero­ gativæ suffultat, quaeso ut pro me, qui impetrastis, orelia.",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 555,
    "date_range": [
      550,
      560
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/florianus-abbas/pl72_46_fl#PL72.FL.2.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/florianus-abbas/pl72_46_fl",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.FL.2.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quoniam Deus præscius futurorum, qui fecit quae ventura sunt, sciens me sanctorum solatio indigere vivorum, ut bonus Dominus preparavit auxilia.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 555,
    "date_range": [
      550,
      560
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/florianus-abbas/pl72_46_fl#PL72.FL.3.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/florianus-abbas/pl72_46_fl",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.FL.3.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Vide ergo quantis adjutoribus uteris, cum pro me coeperis obsecrare sanctae memoriæ dominum Enno­ dium pontificem Ticinensis Ecclesiæ,",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 555,
    "date_range": [
